:''For other uses, see [[Valkyrie (disambiguation)|Valkyrie]].''
'''Li'l Valkyrie''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] who joined in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]] and can be unlocked by rolling the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] during the [[Best of the Best (Gacha Event)|Best of the Best]] event or other special banners. She was a celebratory unit and was released in the '''Taiwanese''' and '''English''' version's 3rd anniversary events and the '''Japanese''' version's 6th anniversary event, replacing [[Shadow Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|Shadow Gao]] or in special [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] variants. She would later be added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.5 Update|Patch 1.0.5]] but is <u>only</u> available in the '''Southeast Asia''' ('''SEA''') version via Package Version Bonus. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]], she was granted the [[Zombie Killer]] ability.

