==Trivia==
*Ironically, Li'l Valkyrie is stronger than her [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|older sister]] in all aspects except range.
*True Valkyrie Cat's [[Media:024 c HD.png|unused wing design]] was later used for Li'l Valkyrie's and [[Li'l Valkyrie Dark (Uber Rare Cat)|Li'l Valkyrie Dark]]'s wing designs, albeit smaller and with less detail. Li'l Valkyrie Dark's wings use said unused design, but with a darker color.
*Prior to [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]], Li'l Valkyrie's English description did not mention her Wave Immunity. Wind Dancer Valkyrie's description was not changed.
*Li'l Valkyrie is tied with [[Dark Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|Gothic Mitama]] for the Cat Unit with the fourth-most abilities in the game, behind [[Lasvoss (Uber Rare Cat)|Lasvoss Reborn]] and [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Elder Mask Doron]] in second, and [[Iz the Dancer of Grief (Uber Rare Cat)|Iz the Lady of Mourning]] in first.
*Like [[Lasvoss (Uber Rare Cat)|Lasvoss]], Li'l Valkyrie's immunity to Curse is useless due to her lacking a trait-specific ability.
*Wind Dancer Valkyrie is one of the only units whose appearance differs between regional versions, the others being [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]], [[Sports Day Cat (Rare Cat)|Sports Day Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]] and Dark Rider Valkyrie.
*Li'l Valkyrie's rarity is different in The Battle Cats Unite, being labeled as a Special cat instead of an Uber Rare, but costing just as much as an Uber.
*She, [[Nekondo (Special Cat)|Nekondo]], [[Baozi Cat (Special Cat)|Baozi Cat]], [[Crazed Baozi Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Baozi Cat]], and Li'l Valkyrie Dark are part of a version exclusive in The Battle Cats Unite, being available to the Southeast Asia version of the game.
**She is obtainable in the Japanese version, however, it can only be unlocked via save editing and thus cannot be obtained through natural means.
*Though she is exclusive to the '''Southeast Asia''' ('''SEA''') version of the game, she was given the Zombie Killer ability in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] in the '''Japanese''' (JP) and '''International''' ('''WW''') versions of the game where she is unobtainable.

